# exported by aisg from topology 'SGB-DUAL-60'
# SYNTHETIC scenario; every parameter is nominal and uncalibrated
# LTE relays modelled as eNodeBs (ns-3 has no LTE relay): RELAY_1, RELAY_2, RELAY_3, RELAY_4, RELAY_5
# dropped fibre NOC-eNB_A: eNodeBs reach the core through the EPC S1 interface
# dropped fibre NOC-eNB_B: eNodeBs reach the core through the EPC S1 interface
# dropped LTE relay backhaul RELAY_1-eNB_A: replaced by the EPC S1 interface
# dropped LTE relay backhaul RELAY_2-RELAY_1: replaced by the EPC S1 interface
# dropped LTE relay backhaul RELAY_3-eNB_B: replaced by the EPC S1 interface
